% ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
% Spectroscopic data. vSmartMOM computes gas absorption from HITRAN line
% parameters (through AtmosphericAbsorption.jl). If you publish results that
% use them, please cite the HITRAN edition you used:
%   - default ("artifact" edition): HITRAN2016 (Gordon2017HITRAN2016);
%   - set_hitran_edition!(...) downloads from hitran.org, which serves only
%     the current edition (HITRAN2024 at the time of writing; Gordon2026HITRAN2024);
%   - local .par files: the edition the file came from (e.g. Gordon2022HITRAN2020).
% Partition sums: TIPS-2021 in AtmosphericAbsorption.jl (Gamache2021TIPS2021);
% TIPS-2017 in the deprecated internal line engine (Gamache2017TIPS2017).
% Cite HAPI (Kochanov2016HAPI) when using non-Voigt profiles or parameters,
% the HITRAN CIA section (Karman2019HITRANCIA) when using HITRAN .cia files,
% and MT_CKD (Mlawer2012MTCKD, Mlawer2023MTCKDHITRAN) when using the water
% vapour continuum. See docs/src/pages/vSmartMOM/References.md.
% ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

